Detailed Description\par
\pard\plain 
{
\pard\plain \s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid {\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
FOR IMPORTER PLUGINS ONLY: The {\b BaseImporter} defines a common interface for all importer worker classes.\par
The interface defines two functions: {\b CanRead()} is used to check if the importer can handle the format of the given file. If an implementation of this function returns true, the importer then calls {\b ReadFile()} which imports the given file. ReadFile is not overridable, it just calls {\b InternReadFile()} and catches any ImportErrorException that might occur. \par
}}
